{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/fe3e40f01710dd93617a5493c3ef44c1.avif?t=1759546982\" width=500 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You're a rogue. You awaken in a cave with only your trusty dagger to begin with. Can you purchase enough upgrades to make it back to the castle and win it all? <br> <br>Taking the progression of an incremental, combine it with a runner and a platformer, and you get Rogue Ascent! Start each run more and more powerful as you collect coins, gems, and artifacts that let you upgrade through the expansive upgrade tree. Sprint, attack, crouch, and jump your way through. Can you unlock it all?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/de90e842b03a8beafa2e06acbc084dbf.webp?t=1759546982\" width=450 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/3e4e5a395fec6ba3627a20802819a73d.avif?t=1759546982\" width=500 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Make your way through 5 different biomes with three different difficulties. Carve your way through a variety of enemies. Explore the caves, mystical forest, town, dungeons, and palace.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/bdea649b82d1743df16f25236e51365b.poster.avif?t=1759546982\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/bdea649b82d1743df16f25236e51365b.webm?t=1759546982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/20758a66fe2913b21b8170a4281b6fcc.avif?t=1759546982\" width=500 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight different bosses to progress and finish each level! Some may be other humans you once knew. But others might be more fantastic in nature!<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/d10a9187fa81214394fd35fd61e36c49.poster.avif?t=1759546982\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/d10a9187fa81214394fd35fd61e36c49.webm?t=1759546982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/49761fe766d05b73aadbd7c481ec38d3.avif?t=1759546982\" width=500 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can you platform your way through obstacles set in your path? Are there secrets to find or do you need to get through as fast as you can?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/e3d3a42bbcd1d1be8c8a7134d9da8e6d.poster.avif?t=1759546982\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/e3d3a42bbcd1d1be8c8a7134d9da8e6d.webm?t=1759546982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/c4b5b816b3161b852670b21f89fa6a6b.avif?t=1759546982\" width=500 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Kill enemies, get gold, gems, or artifacts. Use them to purchase upgrades and expand your choices. Each upgrade is another step in defeating the challenges ahead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/fee7f0df9917cfa8ba92e93dc0b75915.poster.avif?t=1759546982\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/fee7f0df9917cfa8ba92e93dc0b75915.webm?t=1759546982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3965870?t=1759546982","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3965870?t=1759546982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/6051433d894ae776d699fc551f37e439d26851a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759546982","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/6051433d894ae776d699fc551f37e439d26851a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759546982","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\