ebm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/20758a66fe2913b21b8170a4281b6fcc.avif?t=1759546982\" width=500 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight different bosses to progress and finish each level! Some may be other humans you once knew. But others might be more fantastic in nature!<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/d10a9187fa81214394fd35fd61e36c49.poster.avif?t=1759546982\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/d10a9187fa81214394fd35fd61e36c49.webm?t=1759546982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/49761fe766d05b73aadbd7c481ec38d3.avif?t=1759546982\" width=500 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can you platform your way through obstacles set in your path? Are there secrets to find or do you need to get through as fast as you can?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/e3d3a42bbcd1d1be8c8a7134d9da8e6d.poster.avif?t=1759546982\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965870/extras/e3d3a42bbcd1d1be8c8a7134d9da8e6d.webm?t=1759546982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><